<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Ackon's cyber lap | Learn Cybersecurity</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body>

<header id="home">
    <h1>CYBER LAB</h1>
    <p>Learn. Explore. Secure.</p>
    <a href="#learning" class="hero-button">Start Learning</a>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#services">Services</a>
    <a href="#learning">Learning</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<main>

    <section id="about">
        <h2>Welcome to Cyber Lab</h2>
        <p>
            Cyber Lab is a platform dedicated to cybersecurity,
            ethical hacking and digital safety.
        </p>
        <p>
            Our goal is to help beginners develop practical
            cybersecurity skills through learning and practice.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section id="services">
        <h2>What We Do</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Cybersecurity Education</li>
            <li>Ethical Hacking Practice</li>
            <li>Web Security Learning</li>
            <li>Digital Safety Awareness</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="learning">
        <h2>Cybersecurity Learning Hub</h2>
        <p>Build your cybersecurity skills step by step.</p>

        <div class="course">
            <h3>Course 1: Introduction to Ethical Hacking</h3>
            <p>Learn ethical hacking, Linux and network security.</p>
            <span>Beginner Level</span>
        </div>

        <div class="course">
            <h3>Course 2: Linux for Beginners</h3>
            <p>Learn Kali Linux commands and terminal skills.</p>
            <span>Beginner Level</span>
        </div>

        <div class="course">
            <h3>Course 3: Web Security</h3>
            <p>Understand websites, HTTP and common web security risks.</p>
            <span>Beginner Level</span>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>Have a question? Send us a message.</p>

        <form action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST">

            <input
                type="hidden"
                name="access_key"
                value="43fcc397-f2d7-4296-acf1-2bac40176ba5"
            >

            <input
                type="text"
                name="name"
                placeholder="Your Name"
                required
            >

            <input
                type="email"
                name="email"
                placeholder="Your Email"
                required
            >

            <textarea
                name="message"
                placeholder="Your Message"
                required
            ></textarea>

            <input
                type="hidden"
                name="subject"
                value="New message from Cyber Lab"
            >

            <button type="submit">Send Message</button>

        </form>
    </section>

</main>

<footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Cyber Lab. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
